    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d145">

                <pb facs="0371" n="331" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v12/pg331"/>

                <head>145. Memorandum From the Assistant Secretary of State for Near Eastern, South
                    Asian, and African Affairs (Rountree) to the Acting Secretary of State<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d145-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1956-11-18"><hi rendition="#italic">November 18,
                        1956</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Position Paper on the Baghdad Pact</item>
                </list>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Discussion:</hi></p>
                <p>We understand Defense will raise the problem of our immediate adherence to the
                    Baghdad Pact at the November 19 meeting of the NSC Planning Board.</p>
                <p>We have prepared the attached position paper (Tab A) upon which Mr. Bowie could
                    base his remarks if the matter is discussed. This paper also addresses itself to
                    the letter from the Secretary of Defense of November 14 on this subject (Tab
                        B).<anchor n="2" xml:id="d145-f2"/></p>
                <pb facs="0372" n="332" xml:id="pg332"/>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Recommendation:</hi></p>
                <p>That you approve the attached position paper on the Baghdad Pact.</p>


                <xi:include href="d145-a1.xml" xpointer="d145-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
